    on your machine.</p> <h3>Setup</h3> <div class="code"><code>git clone git@github.com:Lissy93/networking-toolbox.git</code> <code>cd networking-toolbox</code> <code>npm install</code></div> <h3>Dev</h3> <div class="code"><code>npm run dev</code></div> <h3>Check 'n Test</h3> <div class="code"><code>npm run hold-my-beer</code></div> <h3>Contributing</h3> <p>Contributions of any kind are welcome (and much appreciated!)<br/> Please read our <a href="https://github.com/lissy93/networking-toolbox/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contribution guidelines</a> before submitting a pull request.</p> <h3>Bugs</h3> <p>Found something that's not working as expected? You can raise an issue <a href="https://github.com/Lissy93/networking-toolbox/issues/new/choose" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a> and I'll look into getting it fixed for you.<br/> For security issues, please see our <a href="https://networking-toolbox.as93.net/security.txt"><code>security.txt</code></a></p></section>`);
}
