				`2. Convert to hex: ${parts.map((p, _i) => `${p} → ${p.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')}`).join(', ')}`,
				`3. IPv4 as hex: ${ipv4Hex} (${ipv4Group1}:${ipv4Group2})`,
				`4. NAT64 prefix: ${prefix} → first 96 bits`,
